              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yehoasi Yehoahazi mvi e’do opi nyazu Samariaa Israeli ma drilia eli kali na drini aziri Yoasi opi Yudaa­rini opi nyazurisi, eri nya opi eli mudri drini azia. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.13.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.13.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 13:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Eri ’ye e’yo ovupi onzi Yehova ma miliari; eri kuni e’yo onzi Yeroboamu Nebati mvini ’yele, azini fele Israelini ’yele, ’diyi ku, te eri aci yi alia ’ dani. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.13.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.13.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
