        {
          "text": "Eri eca ’dini, yini ’ba alu ma avu saria, yi ne ’ba ongulu­muru nde alu ’diyi, yi ’be ’ba nderi ma avu nyadri Elisaniri ma alia; erini Elisa ma fala eloria, coti agu nde enga idriru, so pa uru pa dria. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.13.21",
